# GoHighLevel (server-only). Copy to .env.local and fill in real values.
# In production (Vercel), add these under Project Settings → Environment Variables.
#
# The contact form works out of the box: GHL_MAIN_WEBHOOK_URL has a baked-in
# default (the location's workflow webhook trigger) that fires the SMS/consent
# automation with no config. Set the vars below only to override that default
# or to additionally enrich contacts via the GHL REST API (optional).
GHL_TOKEN=your-ghl-private-integration-token
GHL_LOCATION_ID=your-ghl-location-id
GHL_MAIN_WEBHOOK_URL=your-main-webhook-trigger-url
